ecb.blssurvey2023q4~6d56dfebf7.en.pdf,17,2,The euro area bank lending survey - Fourth quarter of 2023,European Central Bank,D:20240123092349+01'00',D:20240123092121+01'00',,The net percentages for “other factors” refer to an average of the further factors which were mentioned by banks as having contributed to changes in terms and conditions.
