ecb.blssurvey2023q4~6d56dfebf7.en.pdf,17,5,The euro area bank lending survey - Fourth quarter of 2023,European Central Bank,D:20240123092349+01'00',D:20240123092121+01'00',,Banks’ risk perceptions and risk tolerance had a (broadly) neutral impact.
