ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,13,1,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,Chart 5 Changes in the share of rejected loan applications for enterprises (net percentages of banks reporting an increase) Notes: Share of rejected loan applications relative to the volume of all loan applications in that loan category.
