ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,22,0,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,4 Consumer credit and other lending to households 4.1 Pronounced tightening of credit standards Banks reported a pronounced net tightening of credit standards on consumer credit and other lending to households in the second quarter of 2025 (net percentage of 11%; see Chart 12 and Overview table).
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,22,1,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"Credit standards on consumer credit have tightened since the second quarter of 2022, with further tightening in this quarter at a higher pace than in the previous five quarters."
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,22,2,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"The net percentage exceeded what euro area banks had expected in the previous quarter (7%) and was also above the historical average since 2003 (5%).11 In all four largest euro area countries, banks reported a net tightening."
