ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,25,10,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"The slight increase in loan demand was primarily supported by declining interest rates and other factors, while developments in consumer confidence and spending 12 The historical net percentage average of demand for consumer credit since 2003 is 0%."
