ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,25,12,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025 – Consumer credit and other lending to households 24
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,26,0,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,on durable goods put downward pressure on demand for consumer credit (see Chart 14 and Table 12).
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,26,1,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"The lower level of interest rates was reported as factor supporting loan demand in France and Italy, while having a neutral effect in Germany and Spain. “"
