ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,29,1,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,The last period shows expectations indicated by banks in the current round.
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,29,2,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"5.2 Perceived risks to credit quality had a tightening impact on credit standards14 Euro area banks reported a net tightening impact of NPL ratios and other credit quality indicators on their credit standards for loans to firms (net percentage of 6%), housing loans (2%) and consumer credit (10%) in the second quarter of 2025 (see Chart 16 and Table 14)."
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,29,3,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"A tightening impact of credit quality was also observed for terms and conditions, although concentrated in loans to firms and consumer credit (7% and 6% respectively; see Chart 17)."
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,29,4,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"The net tightening of credit standards was lower than in the previous quarter for loans to firms, but the net tightening of terms and conditions was higher, suggesting that past changes in lending criteria of banks are finding their way into actual terms and conditions for firms."
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,29,5,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"This was not the case for consumer credit, for which both credit standards and terms and conditions tightened more than in the previous quarter and which, paired with the overall tightening of credit standards in this sector, points to ongoing revisions of credit policies for consumers."
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,29,6,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,14 Banks were asked to assess the impact of NPL ratios and other credit quality indicators on changes to their lending policies.
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,29,7,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,The question also asked banks about the factors through which NPL ratios and other credit quality indicators contributed to changes to their lending policies.
ecb.blssurvey2025q2~caacd3537b.en.pdf,29,8,The euro area bank lending survey - Second quarter of 2025,European Central Bank,D:20250721173135+02'00',D:20250721173026+02'00',,"Since the April 2025 survey, this question has referred to changes over the past and next three months, while previously (until the January 2025 survey) it referred to changes over the past and next six months."
