ecb.leg_reg_2025_31.en.pdf,1,0,Regulation ECB/2025/31 amending Regulation (EU) 2015_534 on reporting of supervisory financial information,European Central Bank,D:20250910102548+02'00',D:20250910101731+02'00',Templates,"ECB-PUBLIC EN REGULATION (EU) 2025/XX* OF THE EUROPEAN CENTRAL BANK of 9 September 2025 amending Regulation (EU) 2015/534 on reporting of supervisory financial information (ECB/2015/13) (ECB/2025/31) THE GOVERNING COUNCIL OF THE EUROPEAN CENTRAL BANK, Having regard to the Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union, Having regard to Council Regulation (EU) No 1024/2013 of 15 October 2013 conferring specific tasks on the European Central Bank concerning policies relating to the prudential supervision of credit institutions1, and in particular Article 4(1) and (3), Article 6(2), Article 6(5), point (d), and Article 10 thereof, Having regard to Regulation (EU) No 468/2014 of the European Central Bank of 16 April 2014 establishing the framework for cooperation within the Single Supervisory Mechanism between the European Central Bank and national competent authorities and with national designated authorities (SSM Framework Regulation) (ECB/2014/17)2, and in particular Article 21(1), Article 140 and Article 141(1) thereof, Whereas: (1) Regulation (EU) 2015/534 of the European Central Bank (ECB/2015/13)3 lays down reporting requirements concerning the supervisory financial information to be submitted by supervised entities to national competent authorities. ("
ecb.leg_reg_2025_31.en.pdf,1,1,Regulation ECB/2025/31 amending Regulation (EU) 2015_534 on reporting of supervisory financial information,European Central Bank,D:20250910102548+02'00',D:20250910101731+02'00',Templates,"2) Regulation (EU) 2015/534 (ECB/2015/13) requires supervised entities to report supervisory financial information based on the templates developed by the European Banking Authority and laid down by Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2024/31174, which repeals and replaces Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2021/4515."
