ntial challenges for macroprudential authorities will also depend on how banks set their capital targets relative to the parallel frameworks and how they adapt their balance sheet structures to meet prudential and resolution requirements.",TLAC-eligible liabilities are subordinated eligible liabilities subject to further deductions as stated in Article 72e of the CRR. ECB Occasional Paper Series No 374 9
