ntial challenges for macroprudential authorities will also depend on how banks set their capital targets relative to the parallel frameworks and how they adapt their balance sheet structures to meet prudential and resolution requirements.",61 This shortfall stems from mirroring the CBR on top of the LR minimum requirement and bridging it would require up to 0.31% of T1 capital RWA.
