ecb.projections202509_ecbstaff~c0da697d54.en.pdf,40,1,"ECB staff macroeconomic projections for the euro area, September 2025",European Central Bank,D:20250911134753+02'00',D:20250911133613+02'00',,"For inflation, the ECB staff projection is in line with other forecasts for 2025, lies at the bottom of the range for 2026 and is below the other available forecasts for 2027."
ecb.projections202509_ecbstaff~c0da697d54.en.pdf,40,2,"ECB staff macroeconomic projections for the euro area, September 2025",European Central Bank,D:20250911134753+02'00',D:20250911133613+02'00',,The ECB staff projections for HICPX inflation are within the range of other available forecasts for 2025-26 and below the other available forecast for 2027.
