ecb.projections202509_ecbstaff~c0da697d54.en.pdf,40,6,"ECB staff macroeconomic projections for the euro area, September 2025",European Central Bank,D:20250911134753+02'00',D:20250911133613+02'00',,"Additionally, they use different methods to derive assumptions for fiscal, financial and external variables, including oil, gas and other commodity prices."
ecb.projections202509_ecbstaff~c0da697d54.en.pdf,40,7,"ECB staff macroeconomic projections for the euro area, September 2025",European Central Bank,D:20250911134753+02'00',D:20250911133613+02'00',,"The ECB staff macroeconomic projections report working day-adjusted annual growth rates for real GDP, whereas the European Commission and the International Monetary Fund report annual growth rates that are not adjusted for the number of working days per annum."
ecb.projections202509_ecbstaff~c0da697d54.en.pdf,40,8,"ECB staff macroeconomic projections for the euro area, September 2025",European Central Bank,D:20250911134753+02'00',D:20250911133613+02'00',,Other forecasts do not specify whether they report working day-adjusted or non-working day-adjusted data.
