funds, thereby boosting demand and compressing risk premia.","where S denotes the supply of the risky bond, and Aj tXj t represents the dollar allocation of the various investors indexed by j. The overall demand, P j Aj tXj t, is the sum of investors’ assets under management multiplied by their portfolio share in the risky bond."
