funds, thereby boosting demand and compressing risk premia.","We do not observe any significant changes in insurance regulation or bond rating migration during our sample period.20 Taken together, these observations suggest that we should expect a positive shift in demand from mutual funds, while the response from insurance companies is likely to be more muted and potentially negative."
